nd a weight of 189 pounds. On June 21, 2024, his blood pressure was 137/65 mmHg, and his weight was 185 pounds during his obstructive sleep apnea assessment.\n\n• Physical Exam\n - The remainder of the physical examination was unremarkable. Mr. Carroll had normal lung sounds, no signs of respiratory distress, and a normal heart rate. His extremities showed no edema, and his ankle sprain was healing well with appropriate conservative management.\n\n• Additional Notes\n - Mr. Carroll has been compliant with his medical appointments and medication regimen. His most recent spirometry results and sleep study have"
